			(property "Description" "Simple Power Sequencer\n\n• Precision enable pin & 3 open-drain output flags\n• Input Voltage Range of 2.7 V to 5.5 V\n• Power-Up and Power-Down Control\n• LM3880MF-1XY (Timing Designator)  AF16ms AE2ms AA10ms AB30ms AC60ms AD120ms\n• The timing sequence of the LM3880 is controlled entirely by the enable (EN) pin. Upon power up, all the flags are held low until this precision enable is pulled high"
